      "keyLeverage": "改变案件管辖或命令联合审查",
      "defaultPrepare": "要求联合审查并准备转押渠道",
      "defaultCommit": "把案件转入可复核保管，避免先杀后审",
      "dialogueSeeds": [
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n4.zhejiang_governor.01",
          "text": "“人先押回，案卷随后补；谁敢反过来办，谁就在处置簿上具名。”",
          "purpose": "PROBE_OR_FRAME",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.tongwo_prisoners",
            "obj.tongwo_case_file",
            "obj.military_dispatch_channel"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n4.zhejiang_governor.02",
          "text": "“我能改管辖，不能替海瑞在监斩文书上画押。”",
          "purpose": "BARGAIN_OR_THREAT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.tongwo_prisoners",
            "obj.tongwo_case_file",
            "obj.military_dispatch_channel"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n4.zhejiang_governor.03",
          "text": "“若以抗倭为名急杀人，先说这几个人与倭寇究竟有哪一项实证。”",
          "purpose": "HANDOFF_OR_COMMITMENT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.tongwo_prisoners",
            "obj.tongwo_case_file",
            "obj.military_dispatch_channel"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "privateOpening": "胡宗宪能改变管辖和转押，却不能替监斩者签字。救人可能被说成阻挠抗倭，放任处置又会让证言永久消失。",
