      "privatePressure": "拒签必须建立可执行的转押和审查路径，否则只是道德姿态。",
      "keyLeverage": "通过拒签、审讯和证人保护阻断错杀",
      "defaultPrepare": "审问、核时序并保护证人",
      "defaultCommit": "拒绝没有案卷和合法签押的处置",
      "dialogueSeeds": [
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n4.qingliu_law.01",
          "text": "“没有案卷，我不画红；有案卷，也要先看抓人和成供的时序。”",
          "purpose": "PROBE_OR_FRAME",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.tongwo_prisoners",
            "obj.tongwo_case_file"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.qingliu_law"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n4.qingliu_law.02",
          "text": "“齐大柱若只为灾民买粮，谁把买粮写成通倭，谁来当堂说明。”",
          "purpose": "BARGAIN_OR_THREAT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.tongwo_prisoners",
            "obj.tongwo_case_file"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.qingliu_law"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n4.qingliu_law.03",
          "text": "“人犯可以转押，口供可以再问，午时三刻不能替真相作证。”",
          "purpose": "HANDOFF_OR_COMMITMENT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.tongwo_prisoners",
            "obj.tongwo_case_file"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.qingliu_law"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "privateOpening": "海瑞面对的是人犯、案卷和午时三刻，不是抽象的忠奸。拒签若没有转押与再审安排，只会把生死推给下一道强令。",
